Union Agriculture Secretary, Shri Shobhana K. Pattanayak in his address pointed out the multipronged strategy needed to double farmers�� income by 2022. He laid particular emphasis on initiatives to reduce cost of production, bridging the yield gaps in productivity and ensuring better price realisation for our farmers. He particularly emphasised the necessity for adoption of technology in this regard with{r} a{g} view{r} to{r} increase{r} farmers{g}�{r}�{r} productivity{r}.{g}
